One thing which has often annoyed me has been entering a room full of jackals
(or hellhound pups :-) and I end up hitting my pet dog, wasting a turn and
suffering a savaging from several beasties. Surely I would know what my pet
looks like.

My suggestion would be to highlight pets like the main character. If you
befriend a new animal it might take a few turns before it comes into effect...

-- You feel a stronger bond with your pet red dragon --(more)
-- You feel you would know your pet red dragon anywhere --

It's only a small thing, but small touches make a good game great.

